{
  "_readme": [
    "Program title registry — the SINGLE data source for every per-title fact in the repo.",
    "Adding a game title to a program = adding ONE entry to `titles` here and running",
    "`npm run build:mail-templates`. Nothing else. No consumer may branch on a title id.",
    "Consumers: functions/programTitles.ts (server resolver + rubric/ingress), and",
    "scripts/build-mail-templates.mjs (renders the per-title mail blocks into the reviewed",
    "HTML masters between the `program-titles:*` markers).",
    "sampleVideos carry no thumbnailUrl on purpose: the mail sanitizer demotes every image",
    "that is not on an official Supercent host to its alt text (functions/mailCompiler.ts",
    "sanitizeBodyImage), which is exactly what leaked `Play <name> on YouTube` as visible",
    "text in the shipped mail. The rendered rows use a text tile instead of a remote image."
  ],
